{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ alike": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "似ている度 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d photos": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 枚"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld faces will move into “%@”. If it turns out to be wrong, you can fix it from Manage Faces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 枚の顔が「%2$@」に入ります。違っていたら「顔の管理」から戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld photos will move into “%@”. If it turns out to be wrong, you can fix it from Manage Faces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 枚の写真が「%2$@」に入ります。違っていたら「顔の管理」から戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld photos ・ %lld confirmed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 枚 ・ 確認済み %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld were kept separate because they have different names or appear together in the same photo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld件は統合しませんでした（別の名前が付いている、または同じ写真に一緒に写っているため）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(None) Every face of this person was checked and none stood out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（なし）この人物の顔をすべて調べましたが、外れているものはありませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(None) This person has no faces yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（なし）この人物にはまだ顔がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(Not checked) This person has %lld faces, more than the %lld this check covers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（未確認）顔が %1$lld 枚あり、この確認の上限 %2$lld 枚を超えています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A face you said belongs to this person — by confirming it, choosing a cover photo, naming the person, or moving a face here. Confirmed faces are never moved away on their own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなたが「この人だ」と示した顔です（確認・代表写真の選択・名前付け・顔の移動）。確認済みの顔がひとりでに外れることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A group with this name already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ名前のグループが既にあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A person with a name, a confirmed face, or a grouping stays exactly as you left it. Others may be reorganized as new photos arrive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前・確認済みの顔・束ねのどれかがある人物は、あなたが残したまま保たれます。それ以外は写真が増えると組み替わることがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About these numbers": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この数字について"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alike": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "似ている度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyze Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "もう一度調べる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzing faces…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顔を分析中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調べています…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answers are applied right away, and the next overnight analysis uses them too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答はすぐに反映され、次回の夜間解析にも使われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are both of these “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どちらも「%@」さんですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are these the same person?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物ですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both faces appear in the same photo, so they can’t be the same person. Tap the row to see the overlapping photos — if the same face was picked up twice, remove one of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ写真に両方の顔があるため、同じ人にはできません。行をタップすると重なっている写真が出ます。同じ顔を二重に拾っている場合は片方を外してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both have names. Clear one of the names first, or use “Group as Same Person”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "両方に名前が付いています。どちらかの名前を消すか、「同じ人として束ねる」を使ってください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both in the same photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ写真に一緒に写っている"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キャンセル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can’t combine": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一緒にできません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Children change a lot as they grow, so one child can end up as many entries. Confirm them together to merge them quickly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子どもは成長で顔が大きく変わるため、1人が多数に分かれることがあります。「まとめて確認」で一度にまとめられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Cover": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代表写真を選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Cover Photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代表写真を変更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人物を選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Person…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人物を選ぶ…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the correct person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正しい人物を選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the person to group “%@” with as the same person (e.g. a child across ages). Their photos will appear together. You can separate them later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」と同じ人物（例: 成長した子供）として束ねる相手を選びます。写真はまとめて表示され、後で解除できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chosen": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あり"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clean Up This Person…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人物を整理…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear all": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択を解除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閉じる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close enough that the app may ask you about this pair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この組み合わせは「同じ人ですか？」と尋ねられることがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud Share…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クラウド共有…"
          }
        }
      }
