          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物として束ねる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group as same person?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物として束ねますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group name (e.g. family, team)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "グループ名（例: 家族、チーム）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group with": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人物として束ねる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Group with Another Person…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "別の人物と束ねる…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grouped as one person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ人として束ねている"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Groups collect several people into one album (a family, a team, an organization). Select at least 2 people.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複数の人物を 1 つのアルバムにまとめます（家族・チーム・組織など）。2 人以上選択してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How alike two people must be before the app puts them together. It is stricter for people with few photos, so a new person doesn’t swallow someone else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一緒にするために必要な近さです。写真の少ない人物ほど厳しくなります（できたばかりの人物が別人を取り込まないようにするため）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How matching is set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "判定の設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much two faces look alike, as a percentage. 100% is the same face.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 つの顔がどれくらい似ているかを百分率で表したものです。100% は同じ顔です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect Person": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人物を調べる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect This Person…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人物を調べる…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect this person instead": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この人物を調べる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspecting": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調べている人物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is this “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この写真は「%@」さんですか？"
          }
        }
